		{"id":"dc431a52a1e89977","type":"text","text":"# Visions Draft\n\n## Outcomes\n- 2 international jobs summing up to 18k USD, or 1 at 12k\n- Agentic Ecosystem\n- Car + Bike + Container\n- Systematic Growth of Professional Influence Online\n- Systematic Growth of Personal Reach Online\n- Pretty and in Shape\n- Base with or near Brother\n- Delta Operator\n- Have access to more high quality woman\n\n## Aspirational State\n- 🏠👨‍👦Living with Pa and Brother;\n- 🧠💰High engineer income\n- 🏦🤵1+ active business\n- 📦🚗🏍🛥Car + bike + container\n- 💪✈🚁🦋Pretty, strong and in shape\n\n## Domains\n- Pro\n- Aesthetics\n- Lifestyle (digital, photos, trips, social, PUA)\n- Operator\n- Assets\n- Systems\n- Brother (& family)\n\n## Achievements for this Year\n- Increase salary\n- Turn around Cocoricó\n- Start new business\n- Perfect agentic ecosystem & systematizations\n- Get in shape, strong and improve face\n- Leverage digital & improve woman rooster\n\n## Key Tactics\n- Exposure (places, courses, digital, etc)\n- Leverage AI","x":-1060,"y":-1350,"width":559,"height":1530},
		{"id":"19b6a284e3187e8a","type":"text","text":"## 💰 1) Professional\nEnables everything\n\n**AI Mastery**\nKnowledge\nInfluence\n\n**International Jobs**\nStability\nHigh salary  \n\n**Cocoricó & Ventures**\nAI-driven\nIdeas: Setup AI for others; X in Rio; minimarket; Na Medida; Experiment clothes/shoes/etc online with AI","x":-1060,"y":-1880,"width":360,"height":420,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"ed22a1391deea2f6","type":"text","text":"## 👨‍👨‍👦‍👦 2) Brother\nWhat matters\n\n**School**\n\n\n**Skills**\nLanguages\nSports\nMusic\netc\n\n**Teachings**\nAll I know\n\n**Together**\nLive\nBunker\nTrips and fun\n\n**Mom & Dad**","x":-560,"y":-1880,"width":360,"height":420,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"7456b43d86f27a03","type":"text","text":"## 🕺 3) Aesthetics\nTo Boost Confidence\n\n**Face**\nTeeth\nSkin\nEyes\nJaws\n\n**Shape**\nLean\nMuscular\n\n**Style**\nClothes\nAccessories\nTrim\nFragrance\n\n","x":-380,"y":-1350,"width":360,"height":470,"color":"#da62a8"},
		{"id":"fe4ae83c18e82980","type":"text","text":"## 🎈 4)Lifestyle\nWhat I like\n\n**Personal Digital Profile**\nRefactor\nOpen\nSystematize (past & current content)\nGrow\n\n**Segmented Digital Profile**\nIdeas: Brother mentoring; AI; Bike; RJ\nResearch\nDefine\nPlan\nSystematize\n\n**PUA Phase**\nPlan\nSystematize\nEnact\nMeasure\n\n**Social**\nExposure (courses, events, etc)\nMake new Friends and Lovers","x":-380,"y":-810,"width":360,"height":420,"color":"2"},
