		{"id":"1b118c4af195fb46","type":"text","text":"## 🐱‍👤 5) Operator\nCapability to protect\n\n**Motor**\nCar\nBike\nAirplane\nHelicopter\nBoat\nSail\n\n**Martial**\nStreet fight\nGround fight\nStrength & power\nEndurance\nShooting\nThrowing\n\n**Support**\nDrones\nLanguages\n\n**Health**\nQuit smoking","x":-380,"y":-240,"width":360,"height":420,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"d0452f7ce4dbf77a","type":"text","text":"## 🏠 6) Assets\nTo Provide\n\n**Inventory**\nPhysical Assets\nDigital Assets\nFinancial Assets\nBusinesses\n\n**Storage House**\n\n**Car**\n\n**Diligences**\nSeguro de vida\nTestamento\nLimpar nome\nDeclarar IR","x":-560,"y":320,"width":360,"height":420,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"af8b6fd5c84de571","type":"text","text":"**Program**: **AI Mastery & Influence**\nBecome a reference in my field\n\n**How**:\n- Knowledge: Learn all\n- Online exposure: create content & grow popularity\n- Physical exposure: do seminars, events, etc","x":-1760,"y":-2240,"width":420,"height":420},
		{"id":"baf8fbffce9c4165","type":"text","text":"**Project**: **Career Version 2026**\nAchieve salary between 12k-16k USD/month\n\n**How**:\n- Refactor and update professional profile (CV and LinkedIn)\n- Create routine to keep it up to date\n- Leverage AI Mastery & Influence program (i.e., content)\n- Perform well at current jobs\n- Prepare interview rhetoric and talking points\n- Keep doing interviews\n","x":-1550,"y":-2760,"width":420,"height":420},
		{"id":"8cf5341a572b2ca5","type":"text","text":"**Project**: **Cocoricó Revamp**\nTurn Cocoricó net zero and self-running\n\n**How**:\n- Automate with CocoriSuite\n- Find a manager/operator/executive\n- Implement Quality Control\n- Implement Continuous Improvement\n- Document and leverage AI\n- Mitigate Henrique Risk\n- Elabora a plan, e.g.:\n\t- (expand infrastructure)\n\t- (marketing)\n\t- (partner with influencer Allan)\n\t- (drive through)","x":-1060,"y":-2760,"width":420,"height":420},
		{"id":"cdd567ec91b7fbb0","type":"text","text":"**Project: Find a House**\n\n**Project: Build Brother's Bunker**\n\n**Program: Education & Courses**\nSystematically enroll in courses and prep for military college or similar\n\n**Program: Mentorship**\nTeach everything I know; possible record for content or for the record; include other kids and build a fraternity; expand from there if good.","x":-560,"y":-2760,"width":420,"height":420},
		{"id":"fd0f404c095687b5","x":-80,"y":-2760,"width":447,"height":613,"type":"text","text":"**Project: Face Lift 2026**  \nResearch things to improve face; spin offs may become routines (e.g., eye creams) or discrete events (e.g., cirurgy)\n\n**Project: Complete Wardrobe**\nFinish wardrobe (need more shirts, maybe accessories); research and create \"looks\"; leverage repeated looks (fast to assemble); fix watches; watches and fragrances ok for now\n\n**Program: Devon Larratt Shape**\nCurrently is on-going in an ad-hoc manner, which is ok for now; later needs structure, supplements, diet, measurements, etc; links with the Strengh and Power aspect of the Operator\n\n\n\n"},
		{"id":"856a3ba0a5827c3f","x":160,"y":-999,"width":453,"height":609,"type":"text","text":"## Critical Priorities:\n- Janea performance\n- KB performance\n- Agentic ecosystem\n- Cocoricó Revamp\n- Aesthetics\n\n## Next in Line:\n- Career Version 2026\n- Brother (some)\n- Asset Diligences- \n- Personal Digital Profile\n- PUA Phase\n- AI Mastery & Influence - \n- Inventory\n- Brother (some)\n- Storage House\n- Car\n"}
